    <back>
      <floats-group id="article-17974.s17">
        <fig id="article-17974.image.f1" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Electrocardiogram of a Long RP Narrow Complex Tachycardia. This 12-lead electrocardiogram demonstrates a regular, narrow-complex supraventricular tachycardia with a long RP interval and retrograde P-waves (inverted in leads II, III, and aVF; upright in V<sub>1</sub>). Contributed by Y Hafeez, DO</p>
          </caption>
